{"id":"vod_bf_13847","vodId":"13847","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黄昏少女×失忆","name_cn":"黄昏少女×失忆","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/95327dc3800225096e41c8b6d3ccb251.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《黄昏乙女×失忆幽灵》改编自日本漫画家めいびい原作的同名漫画。故事发生在诚教学园初中部，由于历史悠久的缘故，许多不思议事件在校园中广为流传。某日，少年新谷真一迷失在了犹如迷宫一般的校舍之间，夕阳下，一个黑发少女的身影出现在了他的视线中。少女穿着真一没有见过的古老校服，空洞的眼神里充满了哀怨。难道，我遇见了幽灵？真一兴奋的这样想着。原来，幽灵少女名叫庚夕子，15岁那年不幸去世，因为失去了记忆，因此也想不起来究竟是如何死去的，为此苦恼的夕子这才每日徘徊在校园之中，成为了众多灵异事件的始作俑者。作为唯一能够看见夕子存在的人，真一成为了寻找夕子记忆的头号人选，一个名为“灵异调查部”的社团就这样成立了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:50:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshaonvshiyi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huanghunshao